*$ File     : smbj_thermal.LIB
*$ PSPICE thermal models
*$ Revision : 2.0
*$ Date     : May 2025
*$============================================================================
*$ Component Library for Pspice Simulator
*$ Validated with PSpice 17.4
*$ Encrypted with 17.2
*$============================================================================
*$ Model features :
*$ - working at different ambient temperature (different than 27C)
*$ - Thermal electrical behavior taken into account
*$ - typical breakdown voltage are only taken into account
*$ - to help convergence, thermal voltage increasing is limited if device temperature is abnormal
*$ - warning: leakage current could be out of specification according to part-number
