.SUBCKT TRANSIL_SMBJ  A  Cathode  PARAMS:
+ IRM=1u VBRnom=12  IR=1m Cjof=1n
+ AlphaT=0.8m ISF=1f  NF=1  RSF=1m  IKFF=1000
* IRM		Stand-off current at VRM
* VBR		Breakdown voltage
* IR		Reverse current at VBR
* Cjo		junction capacitance at 0V
* AlphaT	temparature coefficient VBR
* IS		Saturation current
* N		Emission coefficient
* RS		Serie rsistance
* IKF		High injection knee current
